@startuml
!pragma teoz true
hide footbox
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam ParticipantPadding 124
skinparam BoxPadding 12
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam maxMessageSize 200
title S06-structured-sequence — source snapshot (not a runtime trace)
participant "obj: 调用者" as obj
participant "ctl: ManagementController" as ctl
participant "svc: ManagementService" as svc
participant "auth: AuthorizationService" as auth
participant "repo: Store" as repo
participant "audit: AuditService" as audit
activate obj
obj -> ctl: 1. setRoleStatus(actor, id, input)
activate ctl
ctl -> svc: 2. roleStatus(actor, id, status)
activate svc
group Same transaction: role status, grant version and success audit
svc -> auth: 3. lock()
activate auth
deactivate auth
note over svc,auth
begin checks rbac:role:status and root department,
then captures the grant limit for this actor before mutation.
end note
svc -> auth: 4. require(Role.class, id)
activate auth
auth -->> svc: role
deactivate auth
svc -> auth: 5. protectRole(actor, role)
activate auth
deactivate auth
||12||
opt Enable
svc -> auth: 6. requireRoleGrantSystem(actor, roleSystem)
activate auth
deactivate auth
||16||
end
note over svc
Set the managed Role.status. If enabled, check the proposed grants.
end note
svc -> repo: 7. flush()
activate repo
deactivate repo
svc -> auth: 8. preserveAdministrator()
activate auth
deactivate auth
note over svc
finish increments the grant version after the integrity check.
end note
svc -> audit: 9. success(actor, ROLE_STATUS, target)
activate audit
note over audit
Capture the current roles for this actor and build the success record.
end note
audit -> repo: 10. save(log)
activate repo
break Failure
repo -->> obj: Persistence error, transaction rolls back
||16||
end
deactivate repo
deactivate audit
||16||
end
note over ctl,svc
Spring commits after the service method finishes, before returning to the controller.
end note
alt Committed
svc -->> ctl: role result
ctl -->> obj: 200 role status updated
else Commit throws
svc -->> obj: Commit error, success response withheld
||16||
end
note over audit
Denied audit events use a separate transaction.
end note
deactivate svc
deactivate ctl
deactivate obj
@enduml